<div class="visit-practical"><strong>Visite libre, sans inscription.</strong><span>6 rue de la Petite Sensive · 44300 Nantes</span></div><div class="dialog-actions"><a class="button" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=6%20rue%20de%20la%20Petite%20Sensive%2C%2044300%20Nantes">Voir l’itinéraire<svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="contact-petons.html?sujet=visite">Une question sur la visite ?<svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></dialog>
